{
    "background_story": "Chipmunk was a tiny, adventurous pilot who lived in a cozy little nest near the airport. He spent most of his days watching planes take off and land, fascinated by the thrill of flight. One day, Chipmunk decided to build his own plane, using twigs, leaves, and other materials he found in the forest. To everyone's surprise, his creation, the 'Nutty Flyer,' actually worked! Chipmunk's first flight was a success, but his landing was a bit rocky. He crash-landed in a nearby bush, but luckily, he was unharmed. Undeterred, Chipmunk practiced and perfected his landing skills, soon becoming known as the greatest aviator in the forest. His signature move was a precision landing on a single acorn, earning him the respect and admiration of his fellow creatures.",
